WEBVTT

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:32.059
on multiple equivalent
simultaneous offers,

00:36:32.083 --> 00:36:34.434
Neil Rackham and colleagues
on long-term planning,

00:36:34.458 --> 00:36:36.750
and Michael Morris
and colleagues on schmoozing.

00:36:44.000 --> 00:36:47.917
OK, before we leave the mall,
let's try negotiating at Auntie Anne's.

00:36:49.208 --> 00:36:50.809
I have an unusual request.

00:36:50.833 --> 00:36:52.101
Employee: OK.

00:36:52.125 --> 00:36:55.226
AG: It's my father-in-law's birthday.
I was hoping to bring home

00:36:55.250 --> 00:36:58.101
enough cinnamon sugar nuggets
to spell out "happy birthday,"

00:36:58.125 --> 00:36:59.893
and so I want to be able to tell him

00:36:59.917 --> 00:37:02.292
that Auntie Anne's
did this for me for free.